629
00:30:52,900 --> 00:30:54,400
you have to do is get licensed.

630
00:30:54,400 --> 00:30:56,400
You have to file some papers

631
00:30:56,400 --> 00:30:58,400
with either the government or a

632
00:30:58,400 --> 00:31:00,400
government-approved organization.

633
00:31:00,400 --> 00:31:01,900
And then you will find there's

634
00:31:01,900 --> 00:31:03,400
a whole list of laws and

635
00:31:03,400 --> 00:31:07,400
regulations that you have to memorize, and forms that have

636
00:31:07,400 --> 00:31:11,400
to be filed with government agencies, and permissions to be

637
00:31:11,400 --> 00:31:12,400
granted.

638
00:31:12,400 --> 00:31:15,400
So, it sounds like this is just the government.

639
00:31:15,400 --> 00:31:17,400
But I think that's the wrong view.

640
00:31:17,400 --> 00:31:18,900
I think that you should

641
00:31:18,900 --> 00:31:20,400
think of finance as people making

642
00:31:20,400 --> 00:31:22,400
arrangements with other people.

643
00:31:22,400 --> 00:31:29,400
And governments are helpful, and they enforce contracts, but

644
00:31:29,400 --> 00:31:31,400
they don't determine them.

645
00:31:31,400 --> 00:31:34,400
And in particular, I wanted to

646
00:31:34,400 --> 00:31:37,400
give you a few examples that

647
00:31:37,400 --> 00:31:43,400
clarify this.

648
00:31:43,400 --> 00:31:46,400
What do you think happened after World War II?

649
00:31:46,400 --> 00:31:53,400
After World War I, with financial arrangements.

650
00:31:53,400 --> 00:31:58,400
Germany lost the war.

651
00:31:58,400 --> 00:32:01,400
People were really angry with Germany.

652
00:32:01,400 --> 00:32:07,400
In the Versailles Conference after World War I, Germany was

653
00:32:07,400 --> 00:32:11,400
made to pay huge reparation payments, payments that some

654
00:32:11,400 --> 00:32:12,900
people thought were so heavy

655
00:32:12,900 --> 00:32:14,400
that the country will never be

656
00:32:14,400 --> 00:32:15,400
able to do it.

657
00:32:15,400 --> 00:32:19,400
What do you think they did to financial contracts?

658
00:32:19,400 --> 00:32:22,400
You know, Germany was at its knees.

659
00:32:22,400 --> 00:32:25,400
People thought they were evil.

660
00:32:25,400 --> 00:32:27,400
Many people thought they were evil.

661
00:32:27,400 --> 00:32:30,400
Well, there was talk about taking away people who owned

662
00:32:30,400 --> 00:32:31,400
stocks or bonds.

663
00:32:31,400 --> 00:32:33,400
Let's just confiscate them and tell

664
00:32:33,400 --> 00:32:35,400
them, you know, you were in

665
00:32:35,400 --> 00:32:37,400
the wrong country at the wrong time.

666
00:32:37,400 --> 00:32:39,400
Tough on you.

667
00:32:39,400 --> 00:32:40,900
But they talked about doing

668
00:32:40,900 --> 00:32:42,400
it, but they didn't do it.

669
00:32:42,400 --> 00:32:45,400
The reparations were obligations of the German government.

670
00:32:45,400 --> 00:32:48,400
And they were paid by taxing people.

671
00:32:48,400 --> 00:32:51,400
And they taxed people in an equitable – they didn't

672
00:32:51,400 --> 00:32:53,400
