673
00:32:53,400 --> 00:32:54,400
The skeptics were right.

674
00:32:54,400 --> 00:32:56,400
Germany never was able to pay the reparations.

675
00:32:56,400 --> 00:32:57,900
But it tried to pay

676
00:32:57,900 --> 00:32:59,400
them by taxing people, not by

677
00:32:59,400 --> 00:33:00,400
confiscating.

678
00:33:00,400 --> 00:33:03,400
Because ultimately, when it came down to it, they thought,

679
00:33:03,400 --> 00:33:05,400
well, you know, Germans are all different.

680
00:33:05,400 --> 00:33:06,400
And some of them supported the

681
00:33:06,400 --> 00:33:07,400
war, and some of them didn't.

682
00:33:07,400 --> 00:33:08,900
And some of them saved all

683
00:33:08,900 --> 00:33:10,400
their lives, and they've got a

684
00:33:10,400 --> 00:33:12,400
big amount of money.

685
00:33:12,400 --> 00:33:14,400
So, let's not confiscate their shares.

686
00:33:14,400 --> 00:33:16,400
So, they didn't.

687
00:33:16,400 --> 00:33:17,400
That's my first example.

688
00:33:17,400 --> 00:33:24,400
Second example.

689
00:33:24,400 --> 00:33:26,400
Iran.

690
00:33:26,400 --> 00:33:28,900
Remember, it was ruled by the

691
00:33:28,900 --> 00:33:31,400
Shah of Iran, who is a secular

692
00:33:31,400 --> 00:33:38,400
ruler, hereditary ruler of Iran, overthrown by a

693
00:33:38,400 --> 00:33:44,400
people's Islamic revolution and the Ayatollah Khomeini

694
00:33:44,400 --> 00:33:50,400
became the spiritual authority for the new country, became

695
00:33:50,400 --> 00:33:51,400
much more Islamic.

696
00:33:51,400 --> 00:33:52,400
All right.

697
00:33:52,400 --> 00:33:53,900
So, what do you think

698
00:33:53,900 --> 00:33:55,400
happened to financial contracts in Iran?

699
00:33:55,400 --> 00:34:00,400
In particular, the Iranian government under the Shah had a

700
00:34:00,400 --> 00:34:03,400
social security system, and they were paying to government

701
00:34:03,400 --> 00:34:05,400
employees pensions.

702
00:34:05,400 --> 00:34:07,400
So, what do you think the Ayatollah did?

703
00:34:07,400 --> 00:34:09,400
Guy's working all his life

704
00:34:09,400 --> 00:34:11,400
for the Shah, we've overthrown the

705
00:34:11,400 --> 00:34:13,400
Shah, do you still get your pension?

706
00:34:13,400 --> 00:34:14,400
What do you think?

707
00:34:14,400 --> 00:34:15,400
They did.

708
00:34:15,400 --> 00:34:17,400
They didn't cancel.

709
00:34:17,400 --> 00:34:19,400
I think it's like common sense.

710
00:34:19,400 --> 00:34:22,400
You come in, you are a totally different government.

711
00:34:22,400 --> 00:34:25,400
Now, you're an Islamic, a radical Islamic government.

712
00:34:25,400 --> 00:34:26,900
Now, I don't say that they

713
00:34:26,900 --> 00:34:28,400
won't do some things that you

714
00:34:28,400 --> 00:34:33,400
don't like, but they see the basic financial contracts and

715
00:34:33,400 --> 00:34:35,400
they preserve them.

716
00:34:35,400 --> 00:34:39,400
The other example I'll give is

717
00:34:39,400 --> 00:34:43,400
South Africa, and that is in

718
00:34:43,400 --> 00:34:50,400
1994, the white apartheid government was replaced by a

719
00:34:50,400 --> 00:34:53,900
government that was elected by

720
00:34:53,900 --> 00:34:57,400
the black majority in South Africa.

721
00:34:57,400 --> 00:34:58,900
So, what do you think

722
00:34:58,900 --> 00:35:00,400
