00:35:02,400 --> 00:35:04,400
Were they confiscated?

725
00:35:04,400 --> 00:35:05,400
No.

726
00:35:05,400 --> 00:35:07,400
I think that this is a principle in history.

727
00:35:07,400 --> 00:35:09,900
Now, I can give other examples,

728
00:35:09,900 --> 00:35:12,400
