00:35:32,400 --> 00:35:37,400
Mohammad Mossadegh in Iran nationalized the oil industry.

737
00:35:37,400 --> 00:35:41,400
Gamal Abdel Nasser in Egypt nationalized the oil industry.

738
00:35:41,400 --> 00:35:43,900
And then, in India, there

739
00:35:43,900 --> 00:35:46,400
